# Set thread pool to a small value to avoid creating too many threads.
# thread-pool-stall-limit=1000000 (ms) is now well within the server-owned
# (Percona) VALID_RANGE(10, UINT_MAX) used in compat mode, so it no longer
# triggers a clamp; use an unsigned-overflow value instead to exercise the
# max-bound clamp, matching the pattern used for e.g.
# thread-pool-prio-kickup-timer.
--thread-pool-size=1
--thread-pool-stall-limit=4294967296
--force-restart
